(758, 6, 'reading', 'Simply enter your email address ___.', '["below", "above", "behind", "ahead"]', 0, 'Nhap dia chi vao o ben duoi: enter... below. EN: Typing into a field shown underneath uses "below".', 'vocabulary', 'marketing', 729, 'SUBSCRIBE TODAY\nStay informed with our weekly business ___ (756). Each edition covers market trends, and subscribers receive ___ (757) access to our webinar archive. Signing up takes less than two minutes; simply enter your email address ___ (758). Join over 50,000 readers ___ (759) trust MarketWatch Weekly.\n\nMarketWatch Weekly'),
(759, 6, 'reading', 'Join over 50,000 readers ___ trust MarketWatch Weekly.', '["who", "which", "whose", "whom"]', 0, 'Menh de quan he chi nguoi lam chu ngu: who. EN: People as subject of the clause need "who".', 'relative-clauses', 'marketing', 729, 'SUBSCRIBE TODAY\nStay informed with our weekly business ___ (756). Each edition covers market trends, and subscribers receive ___ (757) access to our webinar archive. Signing up takes less than two minutes; simply enter your email address ___ (758). Join over 50,000 readers ___ (759) trust MarketWatch Weekly.\n\nMarketWatch Weekly')
